# Release Quality Gates

Before declaring a change release-ready, run applicable checks:

- `alembic upgrade head`
- `pytest tests -q`
- `pytest tests -k "<pattern>" -q` for targeted validation when needed
- Optional static/security checks if installed: `ruff check src scripts tests`, `ruff format --check .`, `bandit --ini .bandit -r src scripts`, `vulture src scripts --min-confidence 80 --exclude .venv`

## Expectations

- Prefer minimal, compatibility-preserving fixes when tests fail.
- Do not silently weaken lint/security standards.
- Record any skipped checks and rationale in the task result.

